config-connector-extensions patch 0008: mockgcp's Cloud Run services.patch honours an update mask and keeps invokerIamDisabled.

For run.gcp.hfl.dev RunService, which updates a service with an update mask of
the top-level fields that differ.
- With an update mask, exactly the masked top-level fields change (by proto
  or JSON name), cleared when the request leaves them unset; written here.
- Without one, the existing behaviour, plus Config Connector pull request
  #14417's (head 9297537a) line keeping invoker_iam_disabled.
Upstream candidate: yes.

